        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Valance for a bed.  Fine linen, with a conventional design containing anthemion(?) ribbon-like bands, leaves, flowers and insects.  The valance is divided into a wide and narrow border.  Worn and spotted.  Mrs. Heinzen inherited this piece of quilting from her great grandmother, a French woman, and can trace it back 120 years but does not know how much older than that it may be."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/24b91ace-68eb-35a0-b21b-ca54acb341db> .

